gr-uwb — high-rate UWB packet detection and capture for GNU Radio 3.10+.

Python namespace (GNU Radio 3.10 style):

    from gnuradio import uwb

C++ headers:

    #include <gnuradio/uwb/uwb_detector.h>

See the repository root README.md and gr-uwb/README.md for build, install,
block list, and examples. After install:

    help(uwb)

Doxygen may be generated from this docs/ tree when Doxygen is available.
